    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304020/extras/60b9f03c065a4cf73a2fd29f7e69ec62.avif?t=1742115858\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Void Protocol\u00a0is an immersive first-person exploration game that makes you explore not the past, but the future! As the protagonist, you will stop all the experiments that are turning people into robots and save the world, but they are not only turning people into robots...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304020/extras/e08e5ef0495c595d233ad0bb82207b80.avif?t=1742115858\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this first person horror experience, you'll explore the future. Try to spot the new things that the past didn't have!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304020/extras/b9b13c5d6845323f5e15964fc9f06532.avif?t=1742115858\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many Entities/Experiments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spooks And Scares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Hour Long</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Unique Levels To Explore</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304020/extras/60b9f03c065a4cf73a2fd29f7e69ec62.avif?t=1742115858\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Void Protocol\u00a0is an immersive first-person exploration game that makes you explore not the past, but the future! As the protagonist, you will stop all the experiments that are turning people into robots and save the world, but they are not only turning people into robots...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304020/extras/e08e5ef0495c595d233ad0bb82207b80.avif?t=1742115858\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this first person horror experience, you'll explore the future. Try to spot the new things that the past didn't have!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304020/extras/b9b13c5d6845323f5e15964fc9f06532.avif?t=1742115858\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many Entities/Experiments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spooks And Scares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Hour Long</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Unique Levels To Explore</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Void Protocol is a single-player horror adventure game set in the eerie future. Solve interesting puzzles, while hiding from insidious horrors waiting for you in the shadows.",
